# Prevent host-built artifacts from leaking into image builds.
# Critical for the frontend: its Dockerfile runs `npm install` (Linux binaries)
# and then COPYs frontend/ — without this, host node_modules (Windows binaries
# for esbuild/rollup) would overwrite them and break Vite inside the container.
**/node_modules
frontend/dist

# VCS / local noise
.git
.gitignore
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
.env.example
